<!-- Step	What Happens
1️⃣	Page loads → Timer starts from 1:00
2️⃣	User enters OTP digits
3️⃣	Click “Confirm” → AJAX sends OTP to /confirmotp
4️⃣	If success → SweetAlert shows success + redirect
5️⃣	If invalid → Error popup
6️⃣	Click “Resend OTP” → AJAX calls /resend-otp
7️⃣	Backend sends new OTP mail, timer resets to 1:00
8️⃣	Popup shows “OTP Resent Successfully” -->
